,"This light is beautiful."],["الْمَسْجِدُ الْقَدِيمُ نَظِيفٌ.","nnn","The old mosque is clean."],["الْحَبِيبُ رَجُلٌ صَالِحٌ.","nnn","The Habib is a righteous man."],["أَحْمَدُ وَلَدٌ صَغِيرٌ.","nnn","Ahmad is a small boy."],["فَاطِمَةُ أُمٌّ صَالِحَةٌ.","nnn","Fatima is a righteous mother."],["أَحْمَدُ فِي الْمَسْجِدِ.","npn","Ahmad is in the mosque."],["الْمَسْجِدُ فِي تَرِيمَ.","npn","The mosque is in Tarim."],["هَلِ الْحَبِيبُ فِي الْمَسْجِدِ؟","pnpn","Is the Habib in the mosque?"],["نَعَمْ، الْحَبِيبُ فِي الْمَسْجِدِ.","pnpn","Yes, the Habib is in the mosque."],["الدَّرْسُ طَوِيلٌ.","nn","The lesson is long."],["لَيْسَ الدَّرْسُ صَعْبًا.","vnn","The lesson is not difficult."],["ذَهَبَ إِلَى الرَّوْحَةِ.","vpn","He went to the rawḥa."],["رَجَعَ إِلَى الْبَيْتِ.","vpn","He returned to the house."],["دَخَلَ الْوَلَدُ مِنَ الْبَابِ.","vnpn","The boy came in through the door."],["نَظَرَتِ الْأُمُّ إِلَى الْوَلَدِ.","vnpn","The mother looked at the boy."],["هَلْ ذَهَبْتَ إِلَى الرَّوْحَةِ؟","pvpn","“Did you go to the rawḥa?”"],["نَعَمْ، ذَهَبْتُ إِلَى الرَّوْحَةِ.","pvpn","“Yes, I went to the rawḥa.”"],["حَفِظَ الْوَلَدُ الدَّرْسَ.","vnn","The boy memorised the lesson."],["خَدَمَ الْوَلَدُ الضُّيُوفَ.","vnn","The boy served the guests."],["يَجْلِسُ الْوَلَدُ فِي الْحَلْقَةِ الْيَوْمَ.","vnpnn","The boy sits in the study circle today."],["تَقْرَأُ مَرْيَمُ الْمُصْحَفَ الْآنَ.","vnnn","Maryam is reading the muṣḥaf now."]],"review":false,"items":[{"ar":null,"en":"In the line about the circle: is the verb past or present? Which word tells the time?","ar_q":null,"star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["Doer: مَرْيَمُ. Object: الْمُصْحَفَ.","Present (يَجْلِسُ); الْيَوْمَ = today","Because the doer, مَرْيَمُ, is a girl"],"answer":"Present (يَجْلِسُ); الْيَوْمَ = today","model":"Present (يَجْلِسُ); الْيَوْمَ = today","note":null,"id":"ea1339fb"},{"ar":null,"en":"In the line about Maryam: why is the verb a “she” form?","ar_q":null,"star":false,"mode":"choose","options":["Bec